              "id": "53718bd9-fe1e-4e02-9e1e-60ec5e7975aa",
              "name": "image_prompt",
              "value": "=Create a professional, modern LinkedIn post image for the following topic: {{ $json.content_topic }}  Style requirements: - Clean, minimalist design - Professional color palette (blues, grays, whites, accent colors) - High-quality, business-appropriate aesthetic - Could include: abstract shapes, technology elements, workspace imagery, or conceptual illustrations - Suitable for LinkedIn feed (16:9 or 1:1 aspect ratio) - No text overlays needed - Photo-realistic or modern illustration style  The image should visually represent the topic in a sophisticated, engaging way that would stop someone scrolling through LinkedIn.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
